00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.020
Sekarang Powerpages mendukung SPA custom,

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:49.940
logika sisi server,

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:51.460
dan pembuatan situs berbasis AI.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.120
Batas antara portal,

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:54.700
low-code, dan aplikasi web profesional

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:55.480
semakin menipis.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:57.780
Inilah hal penting tentang Powerpages.

